WEBVTT

00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:32.893
and a glass of your finest Code 39.

00:00:32.893 --> 00:00:34.744
Server: Would you like any desserts, sir?

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:37.213
Our special is tracking cookie.

00:00:37.213 --> 00:00:40.439
Customer: I'd like a batch of some
zombie tracking cookies, thank you.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.128
Server: Coming right up, sir.

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:45.518
Your food will be served shortly.

00:00:45.518 --> 00:00:49.590
(Applause)

00:00:52.744 --> 00:00:56.033
Maya Penn: I've been drawing ever
since I could hold a crayon,

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.116
and I've been making animated flip books

00:00:58.116 --> 00:01:00.056
since I was three years old.